# tela_launcher.sim — the launcher's clock. The simulator's watch powers on at 10:09:30 UTC.
# The launcher sets its clock every second, but a new text only once a minute: at rest the
# launcher redraws nothing (the report's «Перерисовка в покое»), and the clock still moves on.

wait 1000
expect "10:09" :visible
wait 30000
expect "10:10" :visible
